{"version":1,"content":"<p>本地餐廳的出品一向有水準有保證，隨季節或主題經常推陳出新，近日，多間酒店餐廳推出全新餐單，無論主題或菜式造型都有賣點，再加上因應節日推出的大餐，就更加吸引。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;菌香酒香&lt;br/&gt;尖沙咀時尚</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T06:23:50.610524+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T06:00:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T06:17:14.146780+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T06:17:14.146780+00:00","content_hash":"6f3ac9d10c94471b98feb6de08cfa7b0d2a89d483b22613bb9b8a227ef664723","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}